@startuml SequenceAIConfig


' =========================================================================
' BRANDING & AESTHETIC CONFIGURATION (Minimalist Professional Theme)
' =========================================================================
skinparam backgroundcolor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Space Grotesk"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam defaultFontColor #0F172A
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6

' Styling Elements
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2

' Participant Styling
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam ParticipantFontColor #0F172A

' =========================================================================
' PARTICIPIANTS DEFINITION
' =========================================================================
actor "Clinic Operator\n(Energy Manager)" as Operator
participant "React Client\n(Browser App)" as Client
participant "Express Server\n(API Gateway)" as Server
participant "Groq Cloud\n(AI API Engine)" as GroqAI
participant "GTB Gateway\n(Local Supervision)" as GTB

' =========================================================================
' LIFELINE SEQUENCE
' =========================================================================

== Phase 1: GTB Connectivity Setup ==
Operator -> Client : Inputs remote GTB supervision endpoint URL
activate Client
Client -> Server : GET /api/gtb/ping?endpoint=url (Proxy Call)
activate Server
note right of Server
  Proxying prevents CORS errors
  and protects local network paths.
end note

Server -> GTB : HTTP GET /ping (Network Probe)
activate GTB
GTB --> Server : 200 OK (heartbeat successful)
deactivate GTB

Server --> Client : 200 OK (status: "online")
deactivate Server
Client --> Operator : Green Light - "GTB Connecté avec Succès"
deactivate Client

== Phase 2: Device & Metric Gathering ==
Operator -> Client : Clicks "Synchroniser Équipements"
activate Client
Client -> Server : GET /api/gtb/devices (Fetch Device List)
activate Server
Server -> GTB : GET /api/v1/device-list (Queries Modbus/BACnet registry)
activate GTB
GTB --> Server : Returns array of connected devices (HVAC, Chillers, Meters)
deactivate GTB
Server --> Client : 200 OK (devices array)
deactivate Server
Client -> Client : Updates Zustand local state & pre-renders device cards
Client --> Operator : Renders 8 synchronized active devices
deactivate Client

== Phase 3: Groq AI Energy Profiling & Auto-Config ==
Operator -> Client : Clicks "Analyser avec IA (EnergyOS AI)"
activate Client
Client --> Operator : Triggers spinner "EnergyOS AI analyse vos équipements..."

' Call Groq AI API (via Server proxy for premium backend secret preservation)
Client -> Server : POST /api/groq/auto-config (devices, monthly_baseline)
activate Server
Server -> Server : Compiles optimization prompt including device specs
Server -> GroqAI : POST chat/completions (Llama-3.1 model, payload)
activate GroqAI
note right of GroqAI
  Groq processes devices list
  and 12-month energy baseline,
  optimizing HVAC & lighting cycles.
end note
GroqAI --> Server : Returns clean JSON completion schema
deactivate GroqAI

Server --> Client : 200 OK (eco_schedules, delestage_priority, ipe_thresholds, summary)
deactivate Server

Client --> Operator : Stops spinner; renders clean configuration preview card
deactivate Client

== Phase 4: Verification & Application ==
Operator -> Client : Reviews recommendations and clicks "Accepter"
activate Client

Client -> Client : Saves active config to local storage
Client -> Client : Applies custom energy baseline thresholds to charts
Client -> Client : Triggers simulated telemetry changes (average load reduction ~17.7%)

Client -> Server : POST /api/gtb/apply-config (eco_schedules)
activate Server
Server -> GTB : POST /api/v1/schedules (Configures local relay schedules)
activate GTB
GTB --> Server : 200 OK (timers written)
deactivate GTB
Server --> Client : 200 OK (configuration synchronized)
deactivate Server

Client --> Operator : Displays success notification and triggers live Dashboard optimization views
deactivate Client

@enduml
